            "title": "Microsoft Copilot Studio: Supercharge your workflows with computer use",
            "description": "Add resilient, AI-powered UI automation directly into your workflows with computer use tools. Makers can build reusable, goal-oriented automations that adapt dynamically to website or app changes, while admins maintain governance through access controls, hosted browser management, and environment-level permissions.",
