        {
            "id": 566859,
            "title": "Microsoft Copilot Studio: Use SharePoint lists as a knowledge source",
            "description": "Unlock the full value of your structured data by bringing SharePoint lists directly into your Microsoft Copilot Studio agents. With native support, customers can ground AI responses in up-to-date, business-critical data\u2014such as tasks, inventory, customers, or operations\u2014without manual data movement or complex integrations. This enables more accurate, context-aware copilots that reflect how your business runs, helping teams make faster decisions, reduce errors, and automate workflows with confidence.",
